flowchart LR
  DEV[Developer / Local Code]-->GIT[Git Repository\nmain + develop branches]
  GIT-->CI[CI Pipeline\nInstall + Lint + Typecheck]
  CI-->TEST[Tests\nUnit + API + Tenant Isolation]
  TEST-->BUILD[Build\nReact PWA + Node.js API]
  BUILD-->IMAGE[Docker Images\nTagged Release]
  IMAGE-->DEPLOY[Deploy Workflow\nSSH / Runner]
  DEPLOY-->BACKUP[Pre-deploy\nMariaDB Dump + Restore Point]
  BACKUP-->VPS[VPS\nDocker Compose]
  VPS-->NGINX[Nginx\nDomain + HTTPS]
  NGINX-->APP[Node.js API + PWA]
  APP-->DB[(MariaDB\nMaster + Tenant DBs)]
  APP-->REDIS[(Redis\nQueue + Rate Limit)]
  APP-->FILES[(Encrypted Backups\nObject / Disk Storage)]
  HEALTH[Health Checks\nAPI DB Disk Backup SSL]-->VPS
  LOGS[Logs + Alerts]-->VPS
